6. REAL-TIME FUNCTIONALITY
==================================================

The counter must update instantly while the user types or pastes text.

Calculate:

1. Word count
2. Character count including spaces
3. Character count excluding spaces
4. Sentence count
5. Paragraph count
6. Estimated reading time

Use sensible browser-side counting logic.

Word counting must handle:

- multiple spaces
- tabs
- line breaks
- leading/trailing whitespace
- punctuation
- empty input

Do not count empty whitespace as words.

Sentence counting should be practical and robust rather than pretending to be a perfect linguistic parser.

Reading-time calculation should use a clearly documented approximate reading speed.

